            44730..44734 "    " String("long") content=NONE
            44750..45050 "andle drafts that are encountered.\n\n            `visible` - the draft will visible and fully available\n            `unlinked` - the draft will be rendered, but will not appear in navigation, search, or listings.\n            `gone` - the draft will have no content and will not be linked to (default)." String("How to handle drafts that are encountered.\n\n`visible` - the draft will visible and fully available\n`unlinked` - the draft will be rendered, but will not appear in navigation, search, or listings.\n`gone` - the draft will have no content and will not be linked to (default).\n") content=NONE
